    APP -->|"reading only,<br/>with rules enforced"| FB
    NODE --> RET
    NODE --> OAI
    NODE --> WX
    NODE ==>|"records saved through<br/>the server now"| FB
    MAN -.->|"one command<br/>instead of 7 steps"| RET

